            <rule name="Books of Pain" id="44e2-2123-11d4-f451" hidden="false">
              <description>The Books of Pain can be used once per game, at the beginning of any movement phase. All units, friend or foe (including the bearer's own) with a model within 3" of the bearer count as pinned until the beginning of the owner's next turn.</description>
